TEMPLATE: workflow/progress.tmpl
PURPOSE: Shows workflow progress summary

EXAMPLE OUTPUT:
  Workflow Progress
  ─────────────────
  Phase: 001_INGEST (ingest)

  Progress: 2/5 steps (40%)

    [Done] Step 1: REVIEW
    [Current] Step 2: ANALYZE (checkpoint)
